                                "sense_id": "0a062e72-dc12-387d-b0d6-b4690fb030e3",
                                "text": "I was horrified by their sheeplike acquiescence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a3801a1-4160-4a56-b853-43d3cb090fa0",
                                "sense_id": "0a062e72-dc12-387d-b0d6-b4690fb030e3",
                                "text": "Occasionally I succumb to the vibrations in the atmosphere and follow, sheeplike, the movements of the crowd."
